  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) per dose<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (10 minutes): you hallucinate vividly whatever people nearby describe to you, like a Braindance, with effects the GM decides (a retold memory, a fake story, a nightmare). You're nearly comatose and can't take Actions or Move Actions. Secondary (DV15): addiction. While addicted: INT and COOL -1, and the GM occasionally tells you that you crave it.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While addicted, switch on the \"Deep Dive Addiction\" effect.</li>\n<li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
